<ix:footnote xml:lang="en-us" id="f4371020f-3059-4c8b-a821-e5c6d055a08c">Expected volatility is based on historical volatility of the Company&#8217;s stock.</ix:footnote>
<ix:footnote xml:lang="en-us" id="fc9870b89-88c6-47ba-9e97-96409a04fe9a">The risk-free interest rate is an interpolation of yields on U.S. Treasury securities with maturities equivalent to the expected term.</ix:footnote>
<ix:footnote xml:lang="en-us" id="fded9e00b-dcde-4602-af5f-c97200bac76e">We have assumed a dividend yield of zero as the Company has no plans to declare dividends in the foreseeable future.</ix:footnote>
<ix:footnote xml:lang="en-us" id="ff986a10b-81f0-4bbd-8fb3-53b08dcaa542">Less than 10% of total net sales, accounts receivable, net or raw material and finished goods purchases in the respective periods.</ix:footnote>
<ix:footnote xml:lang="en-us" id="f169cb703-c603-49b7-9bcf-1eb1671e52d8">The numerator for the basic and diluted loss per share is adjusted for additional losses being attributed to controlling interest as a result of the impacts of vested but unreleased RSUs being included in the denominator of the basic and diluted loss per share.</ix:footnote>
<ix:footnote xml:lang="en-us" id="fca164ed2-92e4-46e0-a59f-658f7551bfb6">Operating lease cost and sublease income are recorded within general and administrative expenses in the accompanying unaudited condensed consolidated statements of operations and comprehensive loss.</ix:footnote></ix:hidden>
