     <td style="width: 18pt;"> <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#9679;</p> </td>
     <td style="width: auto;"> <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">certain provisions of our amended and restated certificate of incorporation may only be amended with the approval of at least 66 2/3% of the voting power of all shares of our common stock then outstanding;</p> </td>
