     <td style="width: 18pt;">&#160;</td>
     <td style="width: 18pt;"> <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#9679;</p> </td>
     <td style="width: auto;"> <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">continuous innovation efforts and&#160;enhancement of existing products.</p> </td>
    </tr>

   </tbody>
