  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Gross profit was $77.4&#160;million for the year ended December 31, 2025 as compared to $71.9&#160;million for the year ended December 31, 2024. The increase&#160;in gross profit of $5.5&#160;million, or 7.6%, was primarily due to higher volumes, selling price increases, favorable unit costs,&#160;and lower inventory write-downs, partially offset by increased spend on promotional activity, tariffs and channel mix.</p>
