   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">The total intrinsic values of stock options exercised during the years ended <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025</em>&#160;and <em style="font: inherit;">2024</em> was $<ix:nonFraction id="c140555263" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsExercisesInPeriodTotalIntrinsicValue" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">0.3</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million and $<ix:nonFraction id="c140555264" contextRef="d_2024-01-01_2024-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsExercisesInPeriodTotalIntrinsicValue" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">0.2</ix:nonFraction> million, respectively.</p>
